All thanks for the replies, Bob Klenotiz, Tim Brown, Mike, Whittaker.

All have used Netrain successfully on clusters, there is some useful
information in the archives

A useful link to Compaq documentation on setting up is
http://www.tru64unix.compaq.com/faqs/publications/base_doc/DOCUMENTATION/V50
A_HTML/ARH9CATE/TITLE.HTM

A way to set it up is as follows

up via /etc/inet.local .

inet.local entries :
ifconfig <interface> down
ifconfig <interface> down
ifconfig nr0 <ip address> netmask <netmask> add <interface>,<interface>

Thanks all again

Charlotte

