Hi managers,
		Tru 64 4.0D
		Alpha 3000/400
		TZ88 DLT drive on Turbo channel card.

I have a NT user with about 40GB disk space which I need to get 
backed up. I wanted to try and remotely mount the users FS on the 
Alpha and use the Alpha's DLT drive to back up the remote FS. 
Would that be possible? The NT users has NTFS and FAT16 FS. 
Can 4.0D mount other file systems? If so, what is the syntax for 
the command? I have tried
mount -t nfs computernane:/drive /mountpoint and 
mount -t nfs \\computername:.drive /mountpoint
both have given me the error
