From: Nikola Milutinovic <Nikola.Milutinovic () ev ! co ! yu>
Date: Thu, 09 Nov 2000 13:54:57 +0000
To: tru64-unix-managers
Subject: SUMMARY: Makemap crashes on Tru64 UNIX 4.0F
X-MARC-Message: https://marc.info/?l=tru64-unix-managers&m=97377809617469

Hi all.

Problem solved. I was removing one library after another and it boils
down to Berkeley DB 3.1.17 on Tru64 UNIX 4.0F. That was crashing my
makemap. Luckily, I had DB 3.0 as well and libdb-3.so was just a
symbolic link. Changed that to point to libdb-3.0.db, rebuilt makemap
and it works.

I'll be rebuilding the whole package now.

Thanks to all who took their time to help me pull through.

Nix.
-- 
