--Track root account usage by ordinary users
--Use it  on ordinary user accounts to control their machine access

-Observations:

--Valid only in Base security
--It's another account/password to maintain
--The duplicate root account should be after "root" in /etc/passwd so
file/dir listings show the owner as "root"
--May not work in OSF 3.x
