Thanks Lucio.

His note is below:


won't do it in vi.

The following script "removecr filename" takes care of this (can also do a
bunch of files at a time).

#!/bin/csh -f
foreach i ($argv)
tr -d '\015' < $i > temp.temp
mv -i temp.temp $i
end

Anyhow the trick is to use tr -d.

